<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>滑鼠訓練之食神大賽 - 線上版</title>
    
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/@ruffle-rs/ruffle"></script> 
    
    <style>
        body {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 20px;
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
        }
        #flash-container {
            border: 2px solid #ccc;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>滑鼠訓練之食神大賽</h1>
    <p>Loading... (Ruffle 正在嘗試載入遊戲)</p>

    <div id="flash-container">
        <object data="Unicode_tefrbca1-rip.swf" width="800" height="600" type="application/x-shockwave-flash">
            <param name="movie" value="Unicode_tefrbca1-rip.swf">
        </object>
    </div>
    
    <p>請注意：如果遊戲無法啟動，請嘗試將上面的 `data` 和 `param name="movie"` 替換為其他編號的 SWF 檔案名稱。</p>

</body>
</html>
